      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Two ways in",
      "items": [
        "GitHub users copy the template and open a pull request",
        "Others fill in the Microsoft Form; a workflow writes the entry and opens a draft PR",
        "Both routes meet at the same validation and review"
      ]
